<title>SINGAPORE: Brunei sets Feb Seria Light at $25.35/bbl-sources.</title>
<headline>Brunei sets Feb Seria Light at $25.35/bbl-sources.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brunei has set the price of its benchmark Seria Light crude oil for February at $25.35 per barrel, down $1.40 from January, oil traders said on Monday.</p>
</text>
